            "text": "To adjust hip size, add or remove squares from the width. XS: 9 wide x 5 tall. S: 10 wide x 5 tall. M: 12 wide x 5 tall. L: 13 wide x 5 tall. XL: 15 wide x 5 tall. 2XL: 16 wide x 5 tall. Adjust row count (tall number) to change length."
